motanka-stack-shell (0.1.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial package: Quickshell 0.3.2 and cpptrace 1.0.4 under /opt/motanka,
    built with GCC 16 against motanka-qt6 (24.04) or the archive's Qt 6.10
    (26.04).
  * Build and run against motanka-qt6 (Qt 6.12) on both 24.04 and 26.04;
    drop the 26.04 Conflicts on motanka-qt6 and the archive Qt packages.
    Depend on exactly the motanka-qt6 version built against.
  * Add omasnap 1.26.2, Upstream's screenshot tool, and layer-shell-qt 6.8.3
    built against motanka-qt6, with extra-cmake-modules 6.32.0 and, on
    24.04, CMake 4.5.0 at build time only. omasnap takes its ext-image
    protocol files from the staged wayland-protocols 1.50 (new patch
    omasnap-wayland-protocols-dir.patch) and runs its smoke suite offscreen
    during the build. Its menu entry and icon go under /opt/motanka/share,
    the font and icon licences to /usr/share/doc/motanka-stack-shell/omasnap.
    Depend on tesseract-ocr, tesseract-ocr-eng, wl-clipboard and xdg-utils.
  * Add ttfx 0.5.1, the text effects program of Upstream's screensaver,
    built offline with cargo-1.91 and rustc-1.91 from the crates of the new
    orig-ttfx-crates component, as /opt/motanka/bin/ttfx.

 -- Ruslan Babych <1285978+digitwolf@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
